<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Millipore Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Millipore Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it downgraded Millipore Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Millipore lost 3/4 to 38-7/8.</p>
</text>
